+# Activities
+
+Activities are the events that make up the account timeline, such as cards being added, commented on, assigned, moved, or closed.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of activity from boards you have access to, as a flat array with the newest activity first.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by the user ID(s) who made the change |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5va0kn3cme4f9q1v9hf5y3",
+    "action": "card_assigned",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:40:12.534Z",
+    "description": "David assigned Kevin to \"The logo isn't big enough\"",
+    "particulars": {
+      "assignee_ids": ["03f5v9zkm7gx9j0wnsglz7pxw"]
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/1",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz",
+      "number": 1,
+      "title": "The logo isn't big enough"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+      "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm"
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+`eventable`, `board`, and `creator` use the same representations as the card, board, and user endpoints.
+
+The `url` opens the card the activity belongs to. For `comment_created` events, the URL jumps to the comment on the card.
+
+The `particulars` object exposes event-specific details:
+
+| Action | Particulars |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `assignee_ids` |
+| `card_board_changed` | `old_board`, `new_board` |
+| `card_title_changed` | `old_title`, `new_title` |
+| `card_triaged` | `column` |
+
+Other events return an empty `particulars` object. Missing board, title, or column values are returned as empty strings.
+
+Pagination works as with other endpoints: the response includes `X-Total-Count` and `Link` headers, and you can request subsequent pages with the `page` parameter.
diff --git a/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb
